# Copy this file to `secrets.properties` (same folder) and paste your real value.
# `secrets.properties` is git-ignored, so your key stays local and is never committed.
# After editing, restart the backend.
#
# Serper.dev gives real Google results as JSON (in-page search).
#   1. Sign up (free) at https://serper.dev
#   2. Dashboard -> "API Key" -> copy it
#   3. Paste it below. Free tier: ~2500 searches.
#
# On Render, set this as an environment variable named SERPER_API_KEY instead.

serper.api-key=PASTE_YOUR_SERPER_API_KEY_HERE
